[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    345[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    346[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    347[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Phase B: `%d` conversion details, including overflow of the conversion
